; Cartoon: a rounded, chunky face that reads hand-lettered at 11px.
;
; Original pixel art, not derived from any existing typeface. The obvious
; reference here is proprietary and cannot ship in this repository, and at 7x8
; of ink the character of a casual face comes from roundness, chunky stems and
; the bounce between letters rather than from any curve an outline could carry.
; The bounce is the `jitter` field, applied by the renderer. It only ever
; raises a letter, never drops one: an 11-row body puts descenders on the last
; row already, so a downward offset would saw the tail off the g and the y.
; Eleven entries, a prime, so the pattern does not fall into step with word
; lengths and start looking deliberate.
;
; Caps sit on rows 1-8, x-height on 4-8, descenders on 9-10. Row 0 is kept
; clear so a raised letter has somewhere to go.

id: cartoon
name: Cartoon
notice: Original pixel art for Badge Studio.
jitter: [0, -1, 0, 0, -1, 0, -1, 0, 0, -1, 0]

